# System Info Project
 
Bash scripts for system monitoring.
 
## Scripts
- system-info-project: Shows system information
- disk_monitor.sh: Monitors disk usage
- cpu_monitor.sh: Monitors CPU usage
- memory_monitor.sh: Monitors memory usage
- full_monitor.sh: Complete system monitor
- backup.sh: Takes project backup
 
